t. Did not have this issue in 4.6.\n\nScreenshots:\n\n1. example of an oversized grabber \n2. the normal-sized grabber highlighted, located in the script editor\n3. example of an overlapping oversized grabber\n4. fullscreen of new blank project\n\n<img width=\"732\" height=\"406\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/02764a29-0a63-4538-bb0c-e37bf9ac4d43\" />\n<img width=\"377\" height=\"319\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/069eb47d-7275-4f90-8238-e0b9bd1fe732\" />\n<img width=\"333\" height=\"281\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/60d85819-b24b-4511-8dc5-c3caaffafd70\" />\n<img width=\"1311\" height=\"714\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0326b45b-ec7e-417d-bc92-678de8d4fdb9\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen the editor on the mentioned system\nObserve the scrollbar grabbers in any panel outside the script editor\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nIssue is present on a new blank project","closed_by":{"login":"sienar","id":14915379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTE1Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14915379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sienar","html_url":"https://github.com/sienar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sienar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sienar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sienar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sienar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sienar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sienar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sienar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sienar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sienar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/r